OL,3,GNEWSAMourners gather for funeral of
OL,4,Ateenage crash victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of mourners have gathered for
OL,7,Fthe funeral of an 18-year-old woman who
OL,8,Fwas killed in a car crash last month.
OL,10,FEsme Heaton-Biggs died in hospital
OL,11,Fafter the car she was driving was
OL,12,Finvolved in a collision with a white
OL,13,FMercedes on Bloxham Road, Banbury, on 3
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FOn Thursday, family, friends and
OL,17,Fmembers of the public gathered for a
OL,18,Ffuneral service at St Mary's Church in
OL,19,Fthe north Oxfordshire market town -
OL,20,Fwith many wearing Esme's favourite
OL,21,Fcolour, purple.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
